  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></math>&nbsp;satisfies the functional relation, so<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo largeop=\"true\">&#931;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>&#8734;</mo></munderover><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>terms</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mi>a</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mi>x</mi></msup></math><br />Now, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac></math></p>"
